{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/sequences-progressions/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/sequences-progressions.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Mathematics - Sequences & Progressions","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"accent-gradient text-white sticky top-0 z-40\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-2 bg-white/20 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"mi -list-ol\" data-mi=\"format_list_numbered\">format_list_numbered</span></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Sequences &amp; Progressions</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs opacity-80\">Arithmetic &amp; Geometric Progressions</div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">Progress: <span id=\"progress\">0%</span></div>\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/\" class=\"text-white/90 hover:text-white text-sm\">Back to Math</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <aside class=\"lg:col-span-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl card-glow sticky top-24\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-3\">Contents</h3>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li><a href=\"#definition\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span>Definition</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#methods\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">2</span>Key Methods</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#examples\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">3</span>Examples</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#practice\" class=\"hover:text-purple-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">4</span>Practice</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <section class=\"lg:col-span-3 space-y-6\">\n        <article id=\"definition\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-purple-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -info-circle\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">What are Sequences &amp; Progressions?</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700\">A <strong>sequence</strong> is a list of numbers in a specific order. A <strong>progression</strong> is a sequence that follows a rule. The two main types are <strong>Arithmetic Progression (AP)</strong> and <strong>Geometric Progression (GP)</strong>.</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm bg-purple-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-purple-400\">\n                <strong>Tip:</strong> AP adds the same number each time. GP multiplies by the same number each time.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"methods\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-purple-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -tools\" data-mi=\"handyman\">handyman</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Key Methods</h2>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: AP nth term -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m1\">\n                  <span>1. AP nth Term Formula</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m1\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">The nth term of an AP: <span class=\"font-mono\">a_n = a + (n-1)d</span></p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">a = first term, d = common difference, n = term number.</p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-purple-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-purple-400\">Tip: Use this to find any term in the sequence.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: AP sum -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m2\">\n                  <span>2. AP Sum Formula</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m2\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Sum of first n terms: <span class=\"font-mono\">S_n = n/2 [2a + (n-1)d]</span></p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">a = first term, d = common difference, n = number of terms.</p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-purple-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-purple-400\">Tip: Use this to find the total of several terms.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: GP nth term -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m3\">\n                  <span>3. GP nth Term Formula</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m3\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">The nth term of a GP: <span class=\"font-mono\">a_n = a × r<sup>n-1</sup></span></p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">a = first term, r = common ratio, n = term number.</p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-purple-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-purple-400\">Tip: Use this to find any term in a geometric sequence.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: GP sum -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m4\">\n                  <span>4. GP Sum Formula</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m4\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Sum of first n terms: <span class=\"font-mono\">S_n = a(1 - r^n)/(1 - r)</span> (for r ≠ 1)</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">a = first term, r = common ratio, n = number of terms.</p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-purple-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-purple-400\">Tip: Use this to find the total of several terms in a geometric sequence.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"examples\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-purple-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Worked Examples (step-by-step)</h2>\n              <div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-gray-700\">\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 1: Find the 5th term of AP (a=3, d=2)</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Use formula: a_n = a + (n-1)d</li>\n                      <li>Plug in: a=3, d=2, n=5 → a_n = 3 + (5-1)×2 = 3 + 8 = 11</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">11</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 2: Find the 5th term of GP (a=2, r=3)</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Use formula: a_n = a × r<sup>n-1</sup></li>\n                      <li>Plug in: a=2, r=3, n=5 → a_n = 2 × 3<sup>4</sup> = 2 × 81 = 162</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">162</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 3: Sum of first 4 terms of AP (a=1, d=2)</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Use formula: S_n = n/2 [2a + (n-1)d]</li>\n                      <li>Plug in: a=1, d=2, n=4 → S_4 = 4/2 [2×1 + 3×2] = 2[2+6]=2×8=16</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">16</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 4: Sum of first 3 terms of GP (a=2, r=2)</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Use formula: S_n = a(1 - r^n)/(1 - r)</li>\n                      <li>Plug in: a=2, r=2, n=3 → S_3 = 2(1-2^3)/(1-2) = 2(1-8)/(-1) = 2(-7)/(-1) = 14</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">14</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"practice\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-purple-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Practice Problems</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Type answers and press Check. Hints available.</p>\n\n              <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">1) Find the 6th term of AP (a=2, d=3)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p1\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 17\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb1\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">2) Find the 4th term of GP (a=3, r=2)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p2\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 24\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb2\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">3) Sum of first 5 terms of AP (a=1, d=2)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p3\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 25\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb3\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">4) Sum of first 3 terms of GP (a=2, r=3)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p4\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 26\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb4\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t\">\n                <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Independent Practice</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2\">Try this challenge:</p>\n                <label class=\"block text-sm\">Problem: Find the 7th term of AP (a=4, d=5)</label>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-3\">\n                  <input id=\"ind\" class=\"p-2 border rounded w-60\" placeholder=\"Final answer\">\n                  <button id=\"checkInd\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"fbInd\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                <button id=\"showIndSol\" class=\"text-xs mt-2 text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700\">Show solution</button>\n                <div id=\"indSol\" class=\"mt-3 hidden p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded text-sm\"></div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <button id=\"quizBtn\" class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 z-50 bg-purple-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-purple-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"mi -bolt\" data-mi=\"bolt\">bolt</span> Quiz</button>\n\n  <div id=\"quizModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-50 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 relative\">\n      <button id=\"closeQuiz\" class=\"absolute top-3 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 text-2xl\">×</button>\n      <div id=\"quizContent\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 text-sm text-gray-500\">Sequences &amp; Progressions — interactive lesson</footer>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-purple-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":["@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0 } to { opacity: 1 } }\n    .card-glow { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(99,102,241,0.06); animation: fadeIn 0.45s ease; }\n    .accent-gradient { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#6366f1,#a78bfa); }\n    .step-badge { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.08); color:#7c3aed; padding:.25rem .5rem; border-radius:.5rem; font-weight:600; display:inline-block; width:24px; height:24px; text-align:center; font-size:.75rem }\n    .accordion-content { max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition: max-height .28s ease }\n    .accordion-content.open { max-height:900px }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":["#definition","#methods","#examples","#practice"]}